Let us now consider the case when the matrix sets $\mathcal{F}_1$ and $\mathcal{F}_2$ are uniformly quasi-stable. Note that  egin{multline*} 
orm{  ig( \hat{u}(t, \cdot, \eta) - \exp(H_{11} t) \hat{u}_0  ig) \mathbbm{1}_{|\cdot| \le \Xi(\eta)} }_{L^2} \ \le 
